# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  FRONTEND environment (Vite)
#
#  Everything here is compiled INTO THE BROWSER BUNDLE and is publicly
#  readable by anyone who opens devtools. Only put values here that are
#  safe to publish.
#
#  Never put in this file:
#    - STRIPE_SECRET_KEY   (would let anyone refund / charge)
#    - MONGODB_URI         (full database access)
#    - JWT_SECRET          (would let anyone forge an admin session)
#    - SMTP_PASS           (would let anyone send mail as Nate)
#  Those belong in server/.env only.
#
#  There is nothing else to configure — the admin login is handled
#  entirely by the API using an httpOnly cookie, so no auth keys of any
#  kind live in the frontend.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Where the API server lives. Put it on a subdomain of the main site
# (api.nategaffney.store) so the session cookie is sent with requests.
VITE_API_URL=https://api.nategaffney.store
